      dealing: 'Dealer deals seven cards each (first hand), clockwise. Uppermost undealt card is turned face up for trump. Subsequent hands: six cards each, then five, four, three, two, one. Winner of previous hand chooses trump after looking at their cards; on a tie, players cut for the right to choose.',
    },
    turnFlow: "Player to dealer's left leads. Must follow suit if able; otherwise any card. Highest trump wins the trick, else highest card of the led suit. Trick winner leads next. A player who takes no tricks is knocked out (first such player gets one dog's life hand of one card). Seven hands per game with 7, 6, 5, 4, 3, 2, 1 cards dealt respectively.",
